<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Apr '97 cen budget deficit 126.7 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Apr '97 cen budget deficit 126.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's cumulative central budget deficit widened to 126.7 billion forints in April from 113.1 billion forints in March, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>BUDGET (BLN FORINTS)</p>
<p>			 Jan-April 97   Jan-March 97  Jan-April 96</p>
<p>    REVENUES	   774.5	     573.7	 630.9</p>
<p>    EXPENDITURES     901.2	     686.8	 671.0</p>
<p>    BALANCE	    126.7	     113.1	  40.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures do not include one-off revenues, e.g. privatisation revenues.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
